ons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921330/extras/3d849049d17b5697ba6ebcdf93d619eb.poster.avif?t=1761227552\" width=600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921330/extras/3d849049d17b5697ba6ebcdf93d619eb.webm?t=1761227552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative anti-rotation system that completely eliminates motion sickness in VR.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with force feedback wheels and motion platforms (PC exclusive).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable in VR or on flat screens, with support for ultra-widescreen and Steam Deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique mechanic: drive with one hand and shoot with the other.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 levels with varied objectives and three difficulty settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack composed by Ricardo Ferm\u00edn.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Ivanovich Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921330/001aec7e75ea655e1732ee982c62856aceb53c6d/header.jpg?t=1761227552","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1921330/1633499762/b178ecb27ba6acaa687ed9a3c0b96c04